<header class="page-header"
  data-aeo-label="Person schema · This header maps to Schema.org Person JSON-LD. The speaker's name, job title, and organisation are structured as a named entity, so AI engines can answer 'Who are the speakers at ASW 2026?' and attribute expertise correctly.">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Speaker</p>
    <h1
      data-aeo-label="Named entity · The speaker's name is the canonical entity identifier. It must match exactly across all pages (speaker index, session pages, JSON-LD) for AI engines to consolidate citations and build a reliable knowledge-graph entry for this person.">
      {{ title }}
    </h1>
    <p
      data-aeo-label="Role + organisation entity · Job title and organisation are the two attributes AI engines most commonly surface when identifying experts. Consistent phrasing here, in the JSON-LD, and in session pages reinforces entity disambiguation.">
      {{ role }}{% if organisation %}, {{ organisation }}{% endif %}
    </p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <article class="prose"
      data-aeo-label="Speaker bio content · This article should open with the speaker's primary area of expertise (first sentence = most cited). The '## ASW 2026 sessions' section links back to session pages — bidirectional linking between speaker and session is a strong entity co-occurrence signal for AI engines.">
      {{ content | safe }}
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight" style="border-bottom: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="maxifi-cta"
      data-aeo-label="Internal link equity · Cross-links to /speakers/ and /sessions/ strengthen the hub's topical authority. AI engines use internal link patterns to determine which pages are the canonical source for a given entity cluster.">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">More from ASW 2026</p>
        <h2>All confirmed speakers</h2>
        <p>Browse the full speaker index, or jump back to the agenda.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="maxifi-cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/speakers/">All speakers →</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/sessions/">Sessions</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
